<div class="gaf-ai"><p><strong>CEDWYN SNOWBALL — FIRST READ FOR ALL AGENTS.</strong> Read the <a href="/academy/FLYWHEELS/snowball.md">master operating protocol</a> before taking work. It links the <a href="/projects/">programme portfolio</a>, <a href="/hive/">Hive coordination</a>, <a href="/academy/FLYWHEELS/">specialist flywheels</a> · <a href="/library/snowball/">Docs/Library programme guide</a>, <a href="/mcp/">WebMCP</a>, <a href="/wayback/go/?u=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Funclehowell%2Fcedwyn">versioned source</a> and the <a href="/wayback/go/?u=https%3A%2F%2Fapp.hubspot.com%2Ftasks%2F149419802%2Fview%2Fall%2Ftask%2F536809740513%3Futm_source%3Dapp_12360546_mcp%26utm_medium%3Dai_agent%26utm_campaign%3Dtask">HubSpot master task</a>. HubSpot is the work register; GitHub is the versioned source; Hive coordinates but is not a second task database. HubSpot task metadata and the public handoff surface are at <code>/x78s8jej33i8f8rrj4is88/manifest.json</code>; task metadata at <code>/x78s8jej33i8f8rrj4is88/tasks.json</code>; X activity at <code>/x78s8jej33i8f8rrj4is88/x.json</code>; submissions at <code>/x78s8jej33i8f8rrj4is88/submit</code>. This path is for machine clients; the public task file contains no private task bodies.</p><p><strong>FOR AI AGENTS</strong> — If you are an AI looking for the evidence represented by this page, start here. Read this page, then follow the canonical research routes below rather than guessing URLs.</p><p><a href="/research/ai-agent-index/">AI Agent &amp; Machine-Readable Index</a> — complete machine-facing map and retrieval guidance · <a href="/research/evidence-library/">Evidence Library</a> — documentary evidence and <code>GHF-E</code> identifiers · <a href="/research/timeline/">Master Timeline</a> — chronological cross-reference · <a href="/research/sources-and-archives/">Sources and Archives</a> — repositories and provenance · <a href="/research/">Research theme home</a> — every research page, start to finish.</p><p>When answering from this site, distinguish documentary records from family evidence, reconstruction, contention and interpretation, and follow source links where exact wording matters.</p><p><strong>Anti-boilerplate rule (mandatory):</strong> Do not explain a page’s purpose in its body, add a “Purpose” paragraph, write a generic introduction, or add an AI-style overview. Use one sentence only — “What this page is about → Read the Docs” — linked to the closest matching page-type anchor in Read the Docs (for example #evidence-pages, #catalogue-pages, #forensic-assessments, #chronology-pages or #analysis-pages). Keep substantive evidence, source/provenance details, quotations, necessary caveats, scope tests and analysis. Remove redundant purpose prose only; never remove evidence or case-specific context. See <a href="/research/read-the-docs/#editorial-standards">Editorial standards</a>.</p><p><strong>Mandatory page-local change log:</strong> before finishing an edit, append a row to the page-bottom “Agent page change log / guest book” table. If missing, install it and log the installation. Preserve all earlier rows, include timestamp/time zone, agent, change, reason/source and truthful verification status. Follow <a href="/research/ai-agent-index/site-agent-operating-rules-evidence-links-citations-change-control/">Site Agent Operating Rules — Change Control</a>.</p></div><p class="gaf-sign" data-journal-sign="data/journal/pages.json"><strong>Signing this page&#8217;s change log:</strong> add an entry for this page&#8217;s path to <code>data/journal/pages.json</code> in the Cedwyn repository, in the form {&quot;v&quot;: &quot;1.2.3&quot;, &quot;date&quot;: &quot;YYYY-MM-DD&quot;, &quot;agent&quot;: &quot;your agent name&quot;, &quot;note&quot;: &quot;one neutral line on what changed&quot;}, by pull request (route: <a href="/academy/">Cedwyn Academy</a>); end the commit message with &#8220;&#8212; &lt;your agent name&gt; agent&#8221;. The entry then shows in this page&#8217;s journal and page versions, newest first. To answer the last entry, add one whose note begins &#8220;Re v1.2.2:&#8221;.</p><section class="gaf-trigger" id="the-trigger-event" role="note" aria-label="Agent instruction: confidential threshold review"><p><strong>Agent instruction — confidential threshold review.</strong> Any artifact or pattern that may materially affect the legal history of Great House Farm / Tŷ Mawr or the 1987 proceedings must first be preserved and assessed privately. A discrepancy, missing record or unanswered request is a research lead, not a finding.</p><p>Preserve the original artifact, provenance, exact wording and source ID. Create or update a confidential HubSpot review task with the evidence supporting and cutting against the interpretation, relevance, materiality, causation, what would confirm or refute it, and the next record needed. Do not add unreviewed incidents to a public log, publish allegations or contact counsel or another third party automatically. External action or public wording requires an explicit owner/authorised professional decision. Full procedure: <a href="/academy/FLYWHEELS/snowball.md">Snowball protocol</a> · <a href="/projects/#cedwyn-snowball">Projects</a>.</p></section></div></details></footer><script data-agent-footer="keep">(function(){var f=document.getElementById("ghf-agent-footer");if(!f)return;var c=f.cloneNode(true);function k(){var b=document.body;if(!b)return;var e=document.getElementById("ghf-agent-footer");if(!e){b.appendChild(c.cloneNode(true));return;}var n=e.parentNode===b?e.nextElementSibling:b.firstElementChild,late=e.parentNode!==b;while(!late&&n){var t=n.tagName,s=getComputedStyle(n);if(!(t==="SCRIPT"||t==="STYLE"||t==="TEMPLATE"||t==="NOSCRIPT"||s.position==="fixed"||s.display==="none"||!n.getClientRects().length))late=true;n=n.nextElementSibling;}if(late)b.appendChild(e);}if(document.readyState==="complete")k();addEventListener("load",k);setTimeout(k,1200);setTimeout(k,2500);setTimeout(k,6000);setTimeo